Test Plan Document
==================

Project: Performance Dashboard for Playwright Pulse  
Author: QA Team  
Date: 2025-06-01

Objective:
----------
To verify and validate the performance dashboard components for correctness, responsiveness, and usability.

Test Scope:
-----------
- Dashboard UI Rendering
- Lighthouse Report Integration
- Chart Interactivity (Pie, Line, History)
- Filtering by Status and Device
- Tooltip Functionality (Tippy.js)

Test Strategy:
--------------
- Manual Testing for UI/UX Verification
- Automated Playwright Tests for Regressions
- API Mocking for Backend Independence

Test Cases:
-----------
1. Validate pie chart rendering on load
2. Verify tooltip appears on hover and click
3. Test device filter changes data dynamically
4. Ensure all charts show 'No Data' when input is empty
5. Verify copy-to-clipboard on Share button

Deliverables:
-------------
- `final-log.txt`
- `search-log.txt`
- `initial-data.json`
- Screenshots of dashboard states

